# Monorepo architecture

Project skills live in `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. Before making ANY change (including tasks coming from Linear, Slack or GitHub), read:

- `.agents/skills/tech-stack/SKILL.md`
- `.agents/skills/architecture/SKILL.md`

then the skills for the area you touch (see `AGENTS.md` for the full map). Do not start editing before reading them.

## Package boundaries (summary — `architecture` skill is authoritative)

- `apps/api` must not import from `apps/web`, `packages/frontend-lib` or `packages/ui`. It may import `packages/database`, `packages/common-lib`, `packages/backend-lib`.
- `apps/web` must not import from `apps/api` or `packages/backend-lib`. It may import `packages/ui`, `packages/common-lib`, `packages/frontend-lib`.
- `packages/ui` is pure UI: no business logic, API calls, DB or env access. Check it for an existing component before creating one.
- `packages/database` is the single source of truth for DB access; `apps/api` must not bypass it.
